      "x": 806,
      "y": 484,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 308,
      "text": "Vivo → Demo\n\nCanal → web-app :8080\nIdP → Keycloak :8081\nAzure APIM → Consul Gateway\n  + Envoy sidecars (PEP)\nPing Authorize → OPA\n  + ACL Vault CIBA (PDP)\nAgente de IA → ai-agent\nLLM → LiteLLM\nServidor MCP → user-mcp\nCofre → Vault\nBanco → Postgres\nmTLS CN → SPIFFE / service name",
      "originalText": "Vivo → Demo\n\nCanal → web-app :8080\nIdP → Keycloak :8081\nAzure APIM → Consul Gateway\n  + Envoy sidecars (PEP)\nPing Authorize → OPA\n  + ACL Vault CIBA (PDP)\nAgente de IA → ai-agent\nLLM → LiteLLM\nServidor MCP → user-mcp\nCofre → Vault\nBanco → Postgres\nmTLS CN → SPIFFE / service name",
